{"unit_id":"Ck-epsilon__aura-vision#card-zh","repo":"Ck-epsilon/aura-vision","commit":"88a274aeda65a89a31662db3680bab7144abb26c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Aura Vision 是面向 DSH 网页会话的图片识别插件，在会话输入框右侧提供识图面板。用户可选择图片、粘贴截图或输入图片链接，填写问题后调用视觉模型；长图会切成网格分块识别。面板支持多模态接口配置、默认提示词、识别历史收藏与筛选，并可复制或导出识别结果。适合需要在 DSH 中转录图片、表格和文档的人；可用智谱通道或配置兼容接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.bundle.js:1033-1041","lib/host.js:275-304","lib/host.js:538-589"]}
{"unit_id":"Ck-epsilon__aura-vision#card-en","repo":"Ck-epsilon/aura-vision","commit":"88a274aeda65a89a31662db3680bab7144abb26c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Aura Vision adds image recognition to DSH web chat. Choose, paste, or link an image, ask a question, and send it to a vision model; large images are split into tiles. The panel also supports provider settings, saved prompts, favorited history, and exporting results as documents or images.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.bundle.js:1033-1041","lib/host.js:275-304","lib/host.js:538-589"]}
